WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.544
Hi! I have a new puppy. His name is Max. Let me show you his day!

2
00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:10.641
This is Max. Isn't he cute?

3
00:00:11.691 --> 00:00:13.688
Every morning, I feed him.

4
00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:16.228
He eats very well!

5
00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:22.100
Then I walk him in the park. He runs fast!

6
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.244
And he plays happily with his stick.

7
00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.513
In the afternoon, I gently pet him.

8
00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.541
He loves it!

9
00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:39.853
I train him with simple commands: sit, stay, come!

10
00:00:40.303 --> 00:00:43.647
He learns quickly. He's a smart dog.

11
00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:49.334
My friend has a chameleon. It isn't fast.

12
00:00:49.784 --> 00:00:52.013
It moves very slowly!

13
00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:58.210
At night, Max sleeps comfortably in his bed.

14
00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.889
And you? Do you have a pet?

